<title>USA: Powell Industries Q4 oper shr rises.</title>
<headline>Powell Industries Q4 oper shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended Oct 31.</p>
<p>				1996			1995</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $0.27		    $0.22</p>
<p> Oper net		    2,938		    2,316</p>
<p> Revs			 41,232		   41,703</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   10,789		   10,620</p>
<p>			     YEAR</p>
<p> Oper shr		    $1.00		    $0.67</p>
<p> Oper net		   10,758		    7,080</p>
<p> Revs			170,123		  139,534</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   10,765		   10,611</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 excludes a charge of $0.03 a share from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1996 year excludes a charge of $0.56 a share from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1995 year excludes a charge of $0.13 a share from discontinued operations.</p>
